#: ../../source/declarative/host.rst:2
msgid "6. File Dialogs, Drag-and-Drop, Theme, & Worker Threads"
msgstr "6. 文件对话框、拖放、主题切换与后台线程"

#: ../../source/declarative/host.rst:4
msgid ""
"Desktop applications frequently interact with the OS shell—opening native"
" file pickers, accepting dropped files from Explorer, reading the "
"clipboard, switching themes, and running long tasks off the UI thread. "
"Here is how all four integrate cleanly into the declarative MVU loop."
msgstr ""
"桌面应用经常需要与操作系统外壳协作——打开原生文件选择器、接收资源管理器拖入的文件、读写剪贴板、"
"切换深浅色主题，以及在后台线程运行耗时任务。本章介绍如何将这些能力自然融入声明式 MVU 循环。"

#: ../../source/declarative/host.rst:10
msgid "Capturing ``FluxApp *`` via ``on_start`` and ``on_stop``"
msgstr "通过 ``on_start`` 与 ``on_stop`` 获取 ``FluxApp *``"

#: ../../source/declarative/host.rst:12
msgid ""
"``flux_run`` creates and owns the ``FluxApp *`` instance for you. "
"Populate ``on_start``, ``on_stop``, and ``user`` on ``FluxAppCfg`` to "
"store the ``FluxApp *`` pointer inside ``Model`` for the lifetime of the "
"window:"
msgstr ""
"``flux_run`` 会自动创建并管理 ``FluxApp *`` 实例。在 ``FluxAppCfg`` 上配置 ``on_start`` 、 "
"``on_stop`` 与 ``user`` ，即可在窗口生命周期内将 ``FluxApp *`` 指针保存在 ``Model`` 中："

#: ../../source/declarative/host.rst:54
msgid "Native File & Folder Pickers"
msgstr "原生文件与文件夹选择对话框"

#: ../../source/declarative/host.rst:56
msgid ""
"Include ``<fluxent/flux_filedialog.h>`` and call ``flux_filedialog_post``"
" inside ``update()`` when the user clicks a \"Browse…\" button. It opens "
"the Windows Common Item Dialog without tangling your ``view()`` code and "
"posts the result back as an ``XtkMsg``:"
msgstr ""
"引入 ``<fluxent/flux_filedialog.h>`` ，在用户点击“浏览…”按钮时于 ``update()`` 内调用 "
"``flux_filedialog_post`` ，即可弹出原生 Windows 文件对话框并将选择结果作为 ``XtkMsg`` 投递回 ``update()`` ："

#: ../../source/declarative/host.rst:89
msgid "OLE Drag-and-Drop & Clipboard"
msgstr "OLE 拖放与剪贴板"

#: ../../source/declarative/host.rst:92
msgid "Drop Targets & Drag Sources (``xtk_dragdrop``)"
msgstr "放置目标与拖拽源（ ``xtk_dragdrop`` ）"

#: ../../source/declarative/host.rst:94
msgid ""
"Wrap any container or card in ``xtk_dragdrop(ui, desc, child)`` to accept"
" files or text dragged from Windows Explorer and other apps, or to turn "
"an element into a drag source:"
msgstr ""
"使用 ``xtk_dragdrop(ui, desc, child)`` 包裹任意容器或卡片，即可接收从资源管理器及其他程序拖入的文件或文本，"
"或将该元素设为可向外拖出的拖拽源："

#: ../../source/declarative/host.rst:125
msgid ""
"As with ``TextBox``, duplicate ``(char const *) msg.ptr`` with ``strdup``"
" inside ``update()`` when handling ``MSG_DROP_FILES`` or "
"``MSG_DROP_TEXT``."
msgstr "与 ``TextBox`` 相同，处理 ``MSG_DROP_FILES`` 或 ``MSG_DROP_TEXT`` 时请在 ``update()`` 内用 ``strdup`` 拷贝 ``(char const *) msg.ptr`` 。"

#: ../../source/declarative/host.rst:129
msgid "Clipboard Read & Write"
msgstr "剪贴板读写"

#: ../../source/declarative/host.rst:131
msgid ""
"Include ``<fluxent/flux_data.h>`` inside ``update()`` to read or write "
"the Windows clipboard:"
msgstr "在 ``update()`` 中引入 ``<fluxent/flux_data.h>`` 即可读写系统剪贴板："

#: ../../source/declarative/host.rst:146
msgid ""
"For multi-format clipboard payloads (files, raw RGBA ``FluxBitmap`` "
"images, or custom MIME/clipboard formats), construct a ``FluxData *`` via"
" ``flux_data_create()`` and pass it to ``flux_clipboard_set``."
msgstr ""
"如需写入多格式剪贴板数据（文件列表、RGBA ``FluxBitmap`` 位图或自定义剪贴板格式），"
"可通过 ``flux_data_create()`` 构造 ``FluxData *`` 并传给 ``flux_clipboard_set`` 。"

#: ../../source/declarative/host.rst:151
msgid "Switching Theme, Backdrop, & Window State"
msgstr "切换主题、窗口材质与窗口状态"

#: ../../source/declarative/host.rst:153
msgid ""
"With ``m->app`` stored from ``on_start``, ``update()`` can adjust live "
"window chrome in response to settings controls:"
msgstr "借助 ``on_start`` 保存的 ``m->app`` ，可在 ``update()`` 中响应设置变更并实时调整窗口外观："

#: ../../source/declarative/host.rst:156
msgid ""
"**Theme mode**: ``flux_theme_setmode(flux_app_theme(m->app), "
"FLUX_THEME_DARK);`` (accepts ``FLUX_THEME_SYSTEM``, ``FLUX_THEME_LIGHT``,"
" or ``FLUX_THEME_DARK``)."
msgstr ""
"**深浅色主题** ： ``flux_theme_setmode(flux_app_theme(m->app), FLUX_THEME_DARK);`` "
"（可选 ``FLUX_THEME_SYSTEM`` 、 ``FLUX_THEME_LIGHT`` 或 ``FLUX_THEME_DARK`` ）。"

#: ../../source/declarative/host.rst:158
msgid ""
"**Window backdrop**: ``flux_window_setbackdrop(flux_app_window(m->app), "
"FLUX_BACKDROP_MICA_ALT);`` (accepts ``FLUX_BACKDROP_NONE``, ``MICA``, "
"``MICA_ALT``, or ``ACRYLIC``)."
msgstr ""
"**窗口背景材质** ： ``flux_window_setbackdrop(flux_app_window(m->app), FLUX_BACKDROP_MICA_ALT);`` "
"（可选 ``FLUX_BACKDROP_NONE`` 、 ``MICA`` 、 ``MICA_ALT`` 或 ``ACRYLIC`` ）。"

#: ../../source/declarative/host.rst:161
msgid ""
"**Dynamic window title & close**: "
"``flux_window_settitle(flux_app_window(m->app), L\"Unsaved *\");`` and "
"``flux_window_close(flux_app_window(m->app));`` (for example after "
"confirming an exit ``ContentDialog``)."
msgstr ""
"**动态窗口标题与关闭窗口** ： ``flux_window_settitle(flux_app_window(m->app), L\"Unsaved *\");`` 与 "
"``flux_window_close(flux_app_window(m->app));`` （例如在确认退出 ``ContentDialog`` 后主动关闭窗口）。"

#: ../../source/declarative/host.rst:167
msgid "Background Worker Threads"
msgstr "后台工作线程通信"

#: ../../source/declarative/host.rst:169
msgid ""
"Keep ``update()`` fast and non-blocking by offloading network calls, "
"archive extraction, or heavy indexing to a worker thread. Pass ``FluxApp "
"*`` into your worker context and report progress back via thread-safe "
"message posting:"
msgstr ""
"将网络请求、解压缩或重度索引任务放到后台工作线程中执行，使 ``update()`` 始终保持轻量响应。"
"将 ``FluxApp *`` 传入工作线程上下文，即可通过线程安全的消息投递函数实时回报进度："

#: ../../source/declarative/host.rst:187
msgid ""
"``flux_app_post`` enqueues scalar ``XtkMsg`` values from any thread and "
"wakes the UI loop."
msgstr "``flux_app_post`` 可从任意线程将标量 ``XtkMsg`` 消息入队并唤醒 UI 循环。"

#: ../../source/declarative/host.rst:189
msgid ""
"``flux_app_poststring`` copies the UTF-8 string safely onto the queue and"
" delivers it as ``(char const *) msg.ptr`` inside ``update()`` on the UI "
"thread."
msgstr "``flux_app_poststring`` 安全拷贝 UTF-8 字符串并在 UI 线程的 ``update()`` 中作为 ``(char const *) msg.ptr`` 送达。"

#: ../../source/declarative/host.rst:192
msgid ""
"Always join active worker threads inside ``FluxAppCfg.on_stop`` before "
"the process destroys ``FluxApp``. See "
"``fluxent/examples/installer_wizard/`` for a complete multi-page setup "
"wizard with pause, cancel, and worker synchronization."
msgstr ""
"请在 ``FluxAppCfg.on_stop`` 中等待活动工作线程汇合退出后再结束 ``FluxApp`` 。"
"完整的多页安装向导（含暂停、取消与后台线程同步）可参考 ``fluxent/examples/installer_wizard/`` 。"
